 value="1" @selected(($settings['maintenance_mode']??'0')==='1')>Maintenance — staff can still sign in</option></select></label><label>Favicon (PNG, JPEG, WebP; 32–1024 px)<input type="file" name="favicon" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp"></label></div>@if(!empty($settings['favicon']))<div class="media-preview"><img src="{{ Storage::url($settings['favicon']) }}" alt="Current favicon" width="48"><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="remove_favicon" value="1">Remove favicon</label></div>@endif<p class="small">BDT and Bangladesh are the supported live market. Additional currencies and markets require conversion, tax and delivery integrations before they can be enabled. Only the Super Admin can enable maintenance mode.</p><button class="button" data-confirm="Save general settings and storefront availability?">Save general settings</button></form></x-admin-layout>